# Everything is excluded, then the image adds back only what the dashboard
# needs. A denylist would ship whatever a future directory happens to be
# called; an allowlist cannot.
*

!src/dashboard/
!src/__init__.py
!src/dashboard/static/
!deploy/logs/
!deploy/requirements-dashboard.txt

# Belt and braces. These are already excluded by the `*` above, and they are
# named again because the cost of one of them reaching a public image is
# unrecoverable and a future edit to the allowlist must not be able to admit
# them silently.
config/
prompts/
.env
.env.*
cache/
logs/
*.lock
.git/
.claude/
tests/
replay/
